== Trivia ==
* Lil Blub's original name in Antibirth was "[[anti:Beelzeblub|Beelzeblub]]", and he is referenced as such in the game files.
** In pre-release content for Repentance, his name was Lil Bub, without the "L".
* Lil Blub appears to be a drowned version of {{e|The Duke of Flies}}.
** It is possible that the shell worn by {{e|Min-Min}} is his posthumous version, as this shell that resembles {{e|The Husk}}, the posthumous version of the Duke of Flies.
* When encountered in the {{s|Dross}}, the color palette of Lil Blub and his attacks is altered to fit the floor. {{e|Wormwood}} also features this.

